{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415762","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415762","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041576201:1":{"text":"지금 손에 들고 있는 건...","source_cn":"你手上拿着的是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F340CB8980500B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576202:1":{"text":"치치라고 해요! 인형이지만 제 가장 친한 친구랍니다.","source_cn":"它的名字叫奇奇！是我的玩偶，也是我最好的朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x596AD28BB967EF6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576203:1":{"text":"치치는 정말 대단해요. 저랑 놀아 주고, 나쁜 사람을 만나면 지켜 주기도 하거든요!","source_cn":"奇奇很厉害，不仅能陪我玩，还会在遇到坏人的时候保护我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD2C8C9843CB11EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576204:1":{"text":"사실 나도 좋아하는 인형이 하나 있는데...","source_cn":"其实，我也有一只最喜欢的玩偶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB15C86DD200ED6EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576205:1":{"text":"그럼 이름도 지어 줬겠네요? 그쵸?!","source_cn":"那你一定也给它起了名字！对吧对吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA335403B6363CF4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576206:1":{"text":"응... 에이르라고 해...","source_cn":"是的……它的名字叫艾尔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87A8C6FB329E491D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576207:1":{"text":"에이르는 내가 풀이 죽었을 때 늘 위로해 줘. 꿈속에서도 나를 위해 길을 알려주기도 해.","source_cn":"艾尔总是能在我失落的时候安慰我，在梦境里也是它在为我指...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5746181637B1B66B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576208:1":{"text":"우와, 에이르는 엄청 대단하네요!","source_cn":"哇，艾尔也很厉害呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E3DF9D6E30948E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576209:1":{"text":"말하고 보니 조금 부끄럽네. 이렇게 정식으로 에이르를 누군가에게 소개하는 건 처음이야.","source_cn":"说起来有些不好意思，我还是第一次这么郑重地向别人介绍它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CB8E5C4AB7660D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576210:1":{"text":"어라? 왜요? 친구라고 했잖아요. 왜 더 많은 사람에게 소개해 주지 않는 거예요?","source_cn":"哎，为什么？既然它是你的好朋友，为什么不把它介绍给更多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D4C4547AA1969FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576211:1":{"text":"어떤 사람들은 인형 하나가 왜 이렇게까지 소중한지 이해하지 못하거든... 가끔은 상처받는 말을 내뱉기도 하고.","source_cn":"有些人会不理解，为什么一只玩偶会对我这么重要……他们还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B2E93B7E76633E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576212:1":{"text":"그걸 왜 모를까요?!","source_cn":"这有什么不好理解的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F352D6458EA14FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576213:1":{"text":"외로울 때, 치치와 에이르가 언제나 곁에 있어 주기 때문이잖아요!","source_cn":"当然是因为在我们孤单的时候，奇奇和艾尔总会陪在我们身边啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2483A5A4B9029C58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576214:1":{"text":"이걸 이해하지 못하는 사람들은 당신의 곁에 있어 주지도 않고, 오히려 더 많은 고민을 안겨 준 사람들이겠죠!","source_cn":"那些不理解你的人不仅不会陪在你身边，反倒正是他们给你带...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60542168CC779766","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576215:1":{"text":"확실히, 그런 사람들 때문에 고민이 늘었었지...","source_cn":"我的确也为他们烦恼过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE369C149B083705F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576216:1":{"text":"그러니까 그 사람들 생각 같은 건 신경 쓰지 말아요!","source_cn":"所以，我们就不要去管他们的想法啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD6DFD799B8967F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576217:1":{"text":"분명 저희처럼 치치와 에이르를 좋아하는 사람들이 있을 거예요. 친구는 그런 사람들과 하면 되는 거니까요.","source_cn":"一定会有和我们一样喜欢奇奇和艾尔的人的，我们只要和他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87F26A0A66743DB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041576218:1":{"text":"세상은 넓잖아요! 치치와 에이르, 당신과 저... 우리 모두 분명 친구를 많이 사귀어서, 더 이상 외롭지 않을 거예요!","source_cn":"世界很大很大，奇奇和艾尔，你和我，一定不会孤单的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE735E629F1B55DD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041576219:1":{"text":"맞아... 서로를 이해할 수 있는 친구가 된 우리처럼 말이지?","source_cn":"是啊……就像你和我，不就已经成为可以互相理解的朋友了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44BC395B4E21FFD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041576220:1":{"text":"데이먼, 치치... 너희를 만나고, 이렇게 친구가 될 수 있어서 정말 기뻐!","source_cn":"戴蒙，奇奇……我格温妮丝，很高兴能认识你们，和你们做朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28D3BC98816E1249","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_fl